# V1a (SOFT, card M only): the V5 single-card byte gate under the WATCHER (NoC sanitiser, waypoints) on a reduced scope, copied from tp4-v5split-jobs V1a. V5 (QWEN_FAST_GDN_SPLIT_V=2) is NOT in the w2 profiles: its qualified sha256 triple
# (gdn_seq_block_split.QUALIFIED) is empty and its flag refuses, so this gate is the first step of the licence, not a W2 arm. One card, a 1x1 mesh, four users x 16 rows at the four-card geometry; K5-A against V5 over R1 (seed 17), the column-asymmetric RA and the controls.
# A reduced scope never reads PASS (exit 4 / NO-DECISION): this pass is for a watcher error, a hang and a first sight of any differing byte.
# READ: no watcher error or assert line; the GDN_V5 verdict line; any FAIL names the first differing (user, head, token, tile, half). A watcher error, a hang or a FAIL skips V1b (the window goes on: this is data). Duration (estimate): 20-40 min (container timeout 3 h; a hang trips the per-call watchdog, exit 3, then reset the target card only).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/w2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/w2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the card is resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# CARD M ONLY, BEFORE ANY QUAD JOB: the cardm step runs one board; it never runs while a quad step holds the cards, and the harness refuses while anything else can reach the board.
# The harness's container turns the image's C2 boot hook off (QWEN_C2_SERVING=0) and unsets the baked four-card mesh descriptor (env -u TT_MESH_GRAPH_DESC_PATH); the workflow's
# cardm step waits for other CI's buildx builders instead of refusing the window. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2-1 is the image B0 built (a harness mounts this checkout's scripts, so any current C2 image carries the runtime it needs).
C2_SUPERSEDED_BY=tp4-w2ln-jobs
C2_CARDS=pair
C2_ACTIONS=cardm
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2-1
C2_CARDM_HARNESS=optimisation/ttnn-op/v5split/run_card_m.sh
C2_CARDM_ARGS=--sections selftest,p0,negative --regimes R1,RA --seeds 17 --other-seeds 17
C2_CARDM_ENV=IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2-1 WATCHER=1
